stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DRAFT: Author creates story (/write)
  DRAFT --> PENDING_REVIEW: Submit for review
  PENDING_REVIEW --> APPROVED: Reviewer approves
  PENDING_REVIEW --> REVISIONS_REQUESTED: Reviewer requests changes (ReviewNote)
  REVISIONS_REQUESTED --> DRAFT: Author edits
  REVISIONS_REQUESTED --> PENDING_REVIEW: Author resubmits
  APPROVED --> PUBLISHED: Story goes live
  PUBLISHED --> ARCHIVED: Author/admin archives
  PUBLISHED --> DRAFT: Edit creates linked working draft (draftOf/draftRef)
  DRAFT --> [*]: Deleted by author/admin
  note right of PENDING_REVIEW
    Machine moderation scan runs
    on every submission (grade:
    CLEAN / MILD / FLAGGED / CRITICAL)
  end note
